The file rife.mlpackage holds the RIFE v4.25 frame interpolation network,
converted to Core ML. Both the network and its trained weights come from
Practical-RIFE and are published under the MIT licence; the README of that
project states, under "Trained Model", that "The content of these links is
under the same MIT license as this project".

  Practical-RIFE   https://github.com/hzwer/Practical-RIFE
  Copyright (c) 2021 hzwer

  vs-rife, whose copy of the v4.25 architecture and weights was used for the
  conversion
  https://github.com/HolyWu/vs-rife
  Copyright (c) 2021 HolyWu

